{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32115","headline":"织锦词 · 温庭筠","name":"织锦词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丁东细漏侵琼瑟，影转高梧月初出。\n簇簌金梭万缕红，鸳鸯艳锦初成匹。\n锦中百结皆同心，蘂乱云盘相间深。\n此意欲传传不得，玫瑰作柱朱弦琴。\n爲君裁破合欢被，星斗迢迢共千里。\n象尺熏炉未觉秋，碧池已有新莲子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}